{"name":"-31-1C1-1","beats":[{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,10","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Angelia","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Alright, the time for chit-chat is over."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"},{"type":"background","value":"BG-Monument","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's get started with what we ought to be doing. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"AK-12, what's the status of the quarantine wall?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There are five points about three kilometers beyond the wall where infected creatures are gathering. The reason for that is unknown. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"According to visual inspection, those infected creatures don't seem to be in a stable condition. The garrison troops near the walls have not yet taken action. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Also, according to the latest weather forecast, there might be stormy weather afterwards, which will lead to a big spike in the nearby radiation levels."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"A storm, huh... What terrible weather."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The stormy weather might further agitate the Infected. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"If I were the officer in charge of the quarantine wall's security, now would be the time to disperse those monsters with firepower."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"That's impossible."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Isn't an important international conference about to take place in the city?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"The army will be cautious about using force precisely because of that. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Besides, this place is no longer the nation's capital thanks to Collapse Fluid contamination. Just having sufficient forces to respond to emergencies is problematic in itself. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Right now... Belgrade is nothing more than an ordinary city on the edge of a contaminated zone."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So not many people are going to care about an abandoned capital?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Exactly... Therefore there are fewer forces in reserve here. The various factions also have less strength here compared to other cities. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I think that's the main reason why this place was chosen for this summit."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Even if it comes with the risk of being attacked by infected creatures?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Risk and reward come hand in hand. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Besides... rather than the Infected, the other guys are what we should be focusing on."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You mean the white ones?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","value":"0,3","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Yes... but not just them."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG-Wall","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","value":"0,5","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange looks down at the city below, and her expression grows severe. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Just then, a transmission comes in. She slowly raises a hand to accept it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Statesec has arrived.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Griffin has also passed the test.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I told you Griffin would be fine."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"K","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There will be more tests to come.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The Statesec agent teams will buy you time. I hope your efficiency doesn't disappoint them.","style":{"color":"#00CCFF"}}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"NPC-Jason","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{"commsBox":""}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Mm."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange hangs up."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Angelia","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"},{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"}],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"This city is prosperous now, but how long will this prosperity last?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"},{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":" ...... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":" Team Defy continues surveying the situation near the wall from the vicinity of the memorial."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"BG-Monument","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"blackscreenOff","raw":"黑屏2"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Ange finds AK-12 standing to the side of the memorial plaque. She seems to be inspecting something."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What are you looking at, AK-12?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm looking at this stone plaque. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Why are there no names carved on it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Wake","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Because a single plaque can't hold the names of everyone who needs to be remembered."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So leaving it blank is a warning of sorts, then? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, Ange, won't people come here?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Why do you think that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Since it's a place used to remember one's deceased friends...surely people would come here frequently to pay homage to them, right?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...That is how it should have been. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"But this place has long since been forgotten by the people of the world."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Forgotten?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You must know, AK-12, that humans are forgetful creatures. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"For most people, it is only by forgetting part of the past that they can gain the courage to face the future. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Unfortunately, this memorial plaque and the names it carries have already been placed into the category of things which need to be forgotten."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So it's not just their names, but even the memorial plaque that commemorates them has been forgotten... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It seems a little sad."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"They didn't die to earn your sympathy."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"\"Your name is unknown, your deeds are immortal.\""}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Not everyone is willing to die for their country and what they believe in. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Those people who sacrificed themselves for us ought to be remembered, no matter what reasons they had."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You look like something's weighing on you. Is there something worrying you besides the mission?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I was just being sentimental. Seeing this tombstone makes me think of a lot of my friends. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Former friends. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"You should be able to understand that."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Nyet... this is too difficult for a Doll to understand. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Humans really are strange."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph... you know, yet you pretend you don't. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"It seems we've drifted a little off-topic. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In any case, this is now the most suitable location for us to hide and observe, so let's make good use of it."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Since there's no need to worry about unexpected situations, why are we splitting our forces when we're only a single team to begin with?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Their abilities are more than adequate for them to operate within the city, and we have other helpers there too. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"In comparison, I'm more worried about the purification towers and the quarantine wall. I need to keep my strongest force in reserve."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is she really your strongest? Isn't it because you felt she might be the most unpredictable factor?"}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Saying so, AK-12 directs her gaze toward M4A1, who is standing watch in the distance."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"It took us a long time to find her and AR-15, and we're still not clear what happened while they were gone."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I believe that M4 will not be so easily shaken by the past."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Leaving aside that long blank period, just that final battle with the Military would probably be enough to affect her. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"After all, that explosion engulfed the members of Griffin she once served with, and I can see how she blames herself even if she doesn't say it. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Moreover, she ended up fighting one of the former members of the AR Team..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Her kindness ended up being her undoing. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I understand that kindness very well... but what can you protect with kindness alone? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"As long as you bear the weight of duty, you'll have to walk down this path in the end. You'll harm other people, and harm yourself even more."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't doubt her... She performed adequately back then. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I'm simply worried about whether she can continue fighting as a Tactical Doll."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Angelia","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"If you really are that worried about her, then why don't you go have a chat with her?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"NPC-AngeStreet","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOn","raw":"黑点1"}],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Humph... I just knew you'd dump this troublesome crap on me."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"fadePointOff","raw":"黑点2"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Near the nameless plaque. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"M4 is carrying out her duty and standing watch nearby. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Just then, AK-12 walks over to her."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Room","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is something the matter?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Oh, it's nothing. Just that you looked really bored, so I thought I ought to go show some care and concern for a teammate."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I don't need your care or concern. Let's just do our jobs."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You've become more distant ever since you came back. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"How does returning to the team feel, M4?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"... "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"I don't want to talk about this now."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"So? "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Seems you only like talking to yourself, is that it?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"What do you mean by that?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I wonder..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I'm not the sort of person who talks to themselves. It's just that right now... I'm not in the mood for idle chatter."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}},{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Is it because you want to focus on your mission or because... your partner in conversation isn't the other you?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"..."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"AK12","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"AK-12","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Forget it, just stay this way. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"The more mysterious you become, the more amusing it is to observe you."}]}]},{"sprites":[],"ops":[{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Empty","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":null,"narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"With that, AK-12 leaves M4's side."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":3,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"...Did she... notice something?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"Clear Voice","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"background","value":"black","raw":"BIN"},{"type":"bgm","value":"BGM_Brain","raw":"BGM"}],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You don't know how to hide it at all. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Even if you fake a poker face, others can see right into your heart."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Shut up. I wouldn't even need to do this if not for you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I would have thought that we had a relationship of mutual trust after going through so much together."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I have never trusted you. At the very most, we've just used each other."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"You wound me. I thought we were quite happy working together before."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Tsk... I had no other choice but to do so at the time."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":0,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"Clear Voice","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"There will be more and more situations where you will have no other choice as time goes by. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"Still, that's fine. At the very least, you've accepted my existence. "}]},{"spans":[{"text":"My patience is boundless when it comes to dealing with you."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[],"speaker":"M4A1","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"I won't forget how you lied to me in the past. If you want to obtain what you want, then serve me obediently, OGAS."}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"M4A1Mod","expression":4,"shown":true,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"The Voice of OGAS","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"We're both looking for the path back to ourselves, aren't we?"}]}]},{"sprites":[{"prefab":"The Voice of OGAS","expression":0,"shown":false,"side":"left","tags":{}}],"ops":[{"type":"blackscreenOn","raw":"黑屏1"}],"speaker":"The Voice of OGAS","narrator":false,"pages":[{"spans":[{"text":"Let's walk hand in hand as we travel the road of recollection towards the truth, my sister."}]}]}]}
